{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2021-04-16 10:58:00', 'title': 'COMCAST LAUNCHING 25 WIFI-CONNECTED "LIFT ZONES" ACROSS CONNECTICUT', 'text': 'HARTFORD, CONN., APRIL 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS PART OF ITS ONGOING COMMITMENT TO HELP CONNECT LOW-INCOME FAMILIES TO THE INTERNET SO THEY CAN FULLY PARTICIPATE IN EDUCATIONAL OPPORTUNITIES AND THE DIGITAL ECONOMY, COMCAST TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO EQUIP 25 DIFFERENT CONNECTICUT LOCATIONS – 13 OF WHICH ARE NOW OPEN WITH PLANS FOR 12 ADDITIONAL SITES.'}